<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;<b>{!Case.Account},</b></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><font face="arial" style=""><b>{!Case.PMC_SS_Location__c}/</b></font><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!Case.PMC_SS_Plant__c}</b>&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">has reported an outage {!Today}</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: DSCDefaultFontRegular; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b>&nbsp;.</b></span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">To prevent&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;immediate inconvenience to</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">your shipping plans we wish to advise the following orders identified.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li>Customer PO number</li><li>Mosaic order number</li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We apologize for the impact to your business. Operations are scheduled to resume MM/DD/YY/ ASAP.&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">Once the plant is operational, we will send notification so you may resume product pick up. Please reach&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">out to your Customer Service Representative for further questions</span></div></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.OwnerFullName}</b></font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>